				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "8bb56adb-f2b4-483b-b031-c318241a03e6")
	)
	(text "This is here cuz for some reason precision \n154 Ohm resistors and 47 resistors are \ncheaper than standard value resistors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 85.598 98.552 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b8dc7f01-f9bc-437e-acd8-51cb5070968e")
	)
	(text "2mv/V, 5V input Full bridge 5 wire Load Cell signal amplifier and ADC to 3.3V SPI board. Up to 2000 kSps. \nThe ADS1221 ADC should have it's internal amplifier disabled and gain set to 1. \nThe full range of ADC input is 0 to 5V with with a 2.5V differential signal.\nInput voltage is 12V. SPI digital voltage is 3.3. Load Cell Power OUT is 5V. \nThe board is 60mm H 56mm W. All mounting holes are M2.5. See PCB layout for hole locations."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c31fe404-9341-484f-adde-f5214f25e09a")
	)
	(text "This is going to be in DCM\nmost of the time. But our\noutput cap is big enough\nthat we don't really care."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 159.004 139.446 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d584cea2-db68-4d85-aa1e-8e36078120ba")
	)
